  "details": "You can connect a input port typed `Component` to a output port typed `UdonBehaviour` (see attached 1st image). But it's impossible to connect them in inverted direction (2nd image). That is dragging from output port to input port.\nThe cause:\nIn `Udon\\Editor\\ProgramSources\\UdonGraphProgram\\UI\\GraphView\\TypeExtension.cs`, `IsReallyAssignableFrom` checks port assignability between `IUdonEventReceiver` and `Component`. It lacks for inverted case that is \n```\notherType == typeof(IUdonEventReceiver) && type == typeof(Component)\n```\n\nSDK version: VRCSDK3-WORLD-2021.09.30.16.18",
